# Runtime state, none of which belongs in the repository. Three of these hold
# credentials: auth.json an OAuth token with full access to the Twitch account,
# config.json either a Steam Web API key or a SinfulShadows API key, and
# steam.json the library those fetch. claims.json is drop history - not secret,
# but still nobody else's business.
config.json
auth.json
steam.json
state.json
claims.json
cache/
data/
